   "evidence": "Only seven EU+2 countries offer early-diagnosis training for primary care (OECD, via team notes) [N]; early lung cancer often has no symptoms [general clinical knowledge].",
   "kpi": "Share of primary-care staff trained; red-flag CT referrals",
   "tag": "N"
  }
